flowchart TD

    %% Nodes
    StartPoint(開始)
    ReadImplementationPlan(讀取 Implementation Plan)
    HaveBeforeReviewRecommdation{有無先前的審查建議}
    ReadBeforeReviewRecommdation(讀取先前的審查建議)
    ReviewTask(進行審查)
    RecordReviewResult(記錄審查結果)
    EndPoint(結束)

    %% Edges
    StartPoint --> ReadImplementationPlan
    ReadImplementationPlan --> HaveBeforeReviewRecommdation
    HaveBeforeReviewRecommdation -->|有| ReadBeforeReviewRecommdation
    HaveBeforeReviewRecommdation -->|無| ReviewTask
    ReadBeforeReviewRecommdation --> ReviewTask
    ReviewTask --> RecordReviewResult
    RecordReviewResult --> EndPoint